import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 207 | Plane Transcendent Realm-Wide Responsibilities: Job-Post System from Boundary-Breaking to Origin","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 207 | Plane Transcendent Realm-Wide Responsibilities: Job-Post System from Boundary-Breaking to Origin","no":207,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Plane Transcendent","Responsibilities","Job-Post System","Realm-Wide"],"related":["17-Plane Transcendent Standards","49-Governance Framework and Checks and Balances","179-Nine Realms Overview Energy-Level Watershed"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0207_模块1-位面至高强者全境职责-从破界到本源岗位体系.md","filePath":"en/0207_模块1-位面至高强者全境职责-从破界到本源岗位体系.md"}'),s={name:"en/0207_模块1-位面至高强者全境职责-从破界到本源岗位体系.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,u,p){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-207-plane-transcendent-realm-wide-responsibilities-job-post-system-from-boundary-breaking-to-origin" tabindex="-1">Entry 207 | Plane Transcendent Realm-Wide Responsibilities: Job-Post System from Boundary-Breaking to Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-207-plane-transcendent-realm-wide-responsibilities-job-post-system-from-boundary-breaking-to-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 207 | Plane Transcendent Realm-Wide Responsibilities: Job-Post System from Boundary-Breaking to Origin&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 17, 49, 179</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-strong-ones-are-not-titles-but-job-posts" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Strong ones are not titles, but job posts <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-strong-ones-are-not-titles-but-job-posts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Strong ones are not titles, but job posts&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Plane Transcendent is not an enviable title, but an entire set of public job posts. Document 17 is clear: those reaching Origin Realm and above must invest at least 30% of their time and energy in public responsibility each year. This entry unfolds this &quot;job description&quot; — starting from Boundary-Breaking Realm, through World-Creation Realm, to Origin Realm, how strong ones&#39; responsibilities progressively weigh, and how they find their workstation in the governance structure.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the job-post system&#39;s warrant: the anti-predation axiom stipulates strong ones may not turn posts into private power; the republican axiom of Myriad Races stipulates posts are open to Myriad Races&#39; strong ones, not exclusive to one race; the collective ascension axiom is the entire reason posts exist — lifting Myriad Races forward; the causal self-discipline axiom stipulates post behavior leaves traces throughout and is audited; the law-first axiom stipulates post responsibilities are stable, not idling when individuals leave; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-job-post-progression-from-boundary-breaking-to-origin" tabindex="-1">I. Job-Post Progression from Boundary-Breaking to Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-job-post-progression-from-boundary-breaking-to-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Job-Post Progression from Boundary-Breaking to Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm Segment</th><th>Post Nature</th><th>Core Responsibility</th><th>Time Investment</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm</td><td>Plane-level operations post</td><td>Patrolling planes, repairing plane membranes, maintaining cross-plane channels</td><td>Start taking over</td></tr><tr><td>World-Creation Realm</td><td>World-level construction post</td><td>Creating isolated worlds as resources/sanctuaries, long-term care</td><td>Continuous care</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Cosmic-level advisory post</td><td>Participating in law fine-tuning, highest civilizational decisions, cultivating reserves</td><td>≥30%</td></tr><tr><td>Multiverse direction</td><td>Cross-cosmos coordination post</td><td>Cross-multiverse node networking (pending Terminology Committee calibration)</td><td>Whole-network synergy</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-six-major-post-responsibilities" tabindex="-1">II. Six Major Post Responsibilities <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-six-major-post-responsibilities" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Six Major Post Responsibilities&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 17, Plane Transcendents may choose focus per specialty, but may not completely refuse:</p><ol><li><strong>Anchor guarding</strong>: responsible for stable operation of one or more high-level anchors;</li><li><strong>Civilization advising</strong>: participating in civilizational development direction decisions;</li><li><strong>Mentoring lineage</strong>: cultivating the next generation, especially Origin Realm seeds;</li><li><strong>Plane inspection</strong>: periodically monitoring plane stability and civilizational conditions;</li><li><strong>Crisis response</strong>: bearing core tasks when planes collapse or external invasion occurs;</li><li><strong>Law participation</strong>: participating in cosmic law fine-tuning and optimization.</li></ol><p>Posts are not honorary nameplates, but real watch-duty.</p><h2 id="iii-posts-meshing-with-governance-structure" tabindex="-1">III. Posts Meshing with Governance Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-posts-meshing-with-governance-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Posts Meshing with Governance Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Strong-one posts are embedded in four-layer governance: Anchor Council legislates, Symbiosis Executive Committee administers, Symbiosis Court judicially adjudicates, Anchor Oversight Committee supervises. Origin Realm strong ones may hold seats on the Council, but have no veto-style autocratic power; their post behavior is audited by the Oversight Committee. This structurally eliminates &quot;strong one is dictator.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-returns-and-constraints-of-posts" tabindex="-1">IV. Returns and Constraints of Posts <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-returns-and-constraints-of-posts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Returns and Constraints of Posts&quot;">​</a></h2><p>As return for 30% public time, strong ones enjoy resource priority, law participation rights, space-creation rights, civilizational decision rights, etc. (Document 17). But these returns are &quot;post benefits&quot; not &quot;private privileges&quot;: reclaimed upon retirement or transfer. Posts are tied to benefits, not individuals.</p><h2 id="v-turn-from-overlord-to-guardian" tabindex="-1">V. Turn from &quot;Overlord&quot; to &quot;Guardian&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-turn-from-overlord-to-guardian" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Turn from &quot;Overlord&quot; to &quot;Guardian&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is the job-post system&#39;s deepest meaning: old systems&#39; &quot;plane overlord&quot; treats planes as private property; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;Plane Transcendent&quot; treats planes as a post. The same power magnitude — the former rules, the latter serves. This turn is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s final landing at the strong-one level.</p><h2 id="vi-post-rotation-and-burnout-prevention" tabindex="-1">VI. Post Rotation and Burnout Prevention <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-post-rotation-and-burnout-prevention" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Post Rotation and Burnout Prevention&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Origin Realm strong ones on year-round watch duty also face burnout and responsibility overload. Symbiotic civilization sets up a post rotation system for this: guardians need not guard the same anchor for life, but may rotate among the six responsibilities per specialty and energy; consciousness races, mechanical races and other monitoring-strong genealogies may bear watch-duty, while flesh-body-type strong ones may bear crisis response. Rotation both prevents single-person responsibility overload and lets strong ones accumulate a pan-domain view across posts. Meanwhile, post benefits follow responsibility not the person; once a strong one exits public service due to seniority or will, corresponding privileges are reclaimed, and new passing examinees take over — this guarantees the job-post system is a continuously running public machine, not a lifelong title for the few.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: compiling top-tier power into public posts, eliminating &quot;talent underuse&quot; and &quot;strong ones idle&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: post power split by four-layer governance, strong ones may not privatize public</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style overlords rule planes and prey on beings; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Transcendents stand watch and guard, 30% time in service</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: posts are open to Myriad Races&#39; per-group Origin Realm strong ones, not human-exclusive</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: job-post descriptions, watch-duty systems, and audit standards are all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-network-establishment-of-the-job-post-system" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Network Establishment of the Job-Post System <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-network-establishment-of-the-job-post-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Network Establishment of the Job-Post System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Plane Transcendents&#39; job-post system from Boundary-Breaking to Origin is not honorary titles in Heng Yuan Zhou but established posts. Each post has a clear responsibility list, four-dimensional assessment metrics, and Alaya Network real-time performance records. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s post rotation system ensures no Transcendent holds the same post long-term, preventing power ossification. The law-first axiom requires post setup to obey the law network&#39;s operational needs, not creating posts for people. The universal equal infinite law ensures post-promotion channels are open to all races, selection standards unified, birth not looked at.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Plane Transcendents&#39; job-post system translates &quot;the greater the power&quot; into &quot;the heavier the post.&quot; When strong ones understand they are not kings but watch-duty officers, Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ascension is truly stable.</p><p>In the final analysis, plane transcendent realm-wide responsibilities · job-post system from Boundary-Breaking to Origin described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a> · <a href="./49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Checks and Balances</a> · <a href="./179-九境总览能级分水岭.html">179-Nine Realms Overview Energy-Level Watershed</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{h as __pageData,m as default};
